%% frame: UC8 view my teams, B1–B4 (analysis)
sequenceDiagram
    actor Buyer
    participant UI as MyBlocsUI (boundary)
    participant Ctl as ViewMyTeamsControl (control)
    participant Acc as Account (entity)
    participant M as Membership (entity)
    participant T as Team (entity)
    participant P as Product (entity)

    Buyer->>UI: B1: openMyBlocs(page)
    UI->>Ctl: B2: listMyTeams(buyer, page)
    Ctl->>Acc: B2: memberships(page)
    Acc-->>Ctl: memberships, newest first, and total
    loop each membership on the page
        Ctl->>M: B2: describe()
        M->>T: B2: summary()
        T-->>M: stored status, seats, deadline, price
        M-->>Ctl: role, join time, team summary
    end
    opt the page is not empty
        Ctl->>P: B2: displayFieldsOf(products)
        P-->>Ctl: title and image of each listing still offered (A3: others absent)
    end
    Ctl->>UI: B4: showTeams(rows, total)
    UI-->>Buyer: B4: rows under Active, Completed and Refunded
